  * Battery APIDs are disjoint from the existing keys' 008/4c1 APIDs.
+ *
+ * SM-T290 (SDM429): PMIC arbiter v2 (live FDT qcom,spmi@200f000, ee 0):
+ * core 0x200f000 with the APID->PPID map at +0x800, observer channels
+ * 0x8000 apart at 0x2c00000, ownership table at cnfg 0x200a000 + 0x700.
+ * The charger (qpnp-smb5: chgr 0x1000, dcdc 0x1100, usb 0x1300) and the
+ * gauge (qpnp-qg 0x4800) are on PMI632 = SID 2; the keys' PON is PM8953
+ * SID 0 peripheral 0x08 (read through here, see sweet_keys.c).
  */
